  "description": "Jin-Yeong had suffered abuse since childhood. It was his current wife who first reached out to him. But then his wife fell ill, and he found himself facing enormous medical bills... As Jin-Yeong sank into despair, living day by day, a “wall that reads minds” appeared, whether by chance or fate, offering him the chance to earn a large sum of money. Will Jin-Yeong be able to use the wall to save his wife and regain the warmth of their daily life?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
